    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731230/extras/7cd4c503a44b46db59a88c2533f56eeb.poster.avif?t=1693218522\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731230/extras/7cd4c503a44b46db59a88c2533f56eeb.webm?t=1693218522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731230/extras/7cd4c503a44b46db59a88c2533f56eeb.mp4?t=1693218522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<strong><i>RoFIsh: Prelude</i></strong> is a first person adventure about a cat named Stas,\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731230/extras/87602c53e69f85b0ae677a695c45dbe6.poster.avif?t=1693218522\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731230/extras/87602c53e69f85b0ae677a695c45dbe6.webp?t=1693218522\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0trying to escape an island after a shipwreck.<br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Throughout the game you will get to witness<br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731230/extras/87602c53e69f85b0ae677a695c45dbe6.poster.avif?t=1693218522\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731230/extras/87602c53e69f85b0ae677a695c45dbe6.webp?t=1693218522\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0a deliberately clawch\u00e9d plot, absurd dialogs and drunkard crabs.<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731230/extras/0deacbcebab9a806d6bb6b2946950805.poster.avif?t=1693218522\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731230/extras/0deacbcebab9a806d6bb6b2946950805.webm?t=1693218522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Upon waking up Stas faces the fact that his ship is broken and he has to fix it.<br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0But where would he get supplies and tools on an uninhabited island?\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731230/extras/87602c53e69f85b0ae677a695c45dbe6.poster.avif?t=1693218522\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src